---
// Homepage hero — provocative, on-brand opener.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container inner">
    <p class="label reveal reveal-1">Lične finansije · Investiranje · Srbija</p>
    <h1 class="reveal reveal-2">
      Investiranje nije kockanje.<br />
      <em>Ali nije ni magija.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="lede reveal reveal-3">
      Niko ti neće rešiti pare umesto tebe — ni država, ni gazda, ni sreća.
      Ovde učiš kako da preuzmeš kontrolu nad svojim novcem, otplatiš dugove
      i konačno počneš da gradiš nešto svoje. Bez ulepšavanja.
    </p>
    <div class="cta reveal reveal-4">
      <a href="/blog/7-koraka-do-finansijske-slobode" class="btn btn-primary">
        Počni od 7 koraka →
      </a>
      <a href="/blog" class="btn btn-ghost">Čitaj blog</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--navy-700);
    color: var(--text-on-dark);
    padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }
  .bg {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(60% 80% at 75% 10%, rgba(29, 181, 138, 0.18), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(50% 60% at 10% 90%, rgba(29, 69, 117, 0.55), transparent 70%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--navy-600), var(--navy-700));
  }
  .bg::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 48px 48px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(70% 70% at 50% 30%, #000, transparent);
  }
  .inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 56rem; }
  h1 {
    color: #fff; font-size: var(--step-5); font-weight: 600; margin: 0.6rem 0 1.2rem;
  }
  h1 em { color: var(--emerald-bright); font-style: italic; }
  .lede { font-size: var(--step-1); color: var(--text-on-dark-dim); max-width: 52ch; line-height: 1.55; }
  .cta { display: flex; gap: 0.9rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 2rem; }
</style>
